WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:14.700
what we now see in the Middle East is the&nbsp;
same pattern of conquest with which we became&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:22.800
familiar during the period of 1945 to 1950&nbsp;
this involves taking over a nation by means&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:30.240
of indirect aggression that is under the cover&nbsp;
of a fomented civil strife the purpose is to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:39.690
put into domestic control those whose real&nbsp;
loyalty is to the aggressor it was by such&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:46.650
means that the Communists attempted to take&nbsp;
over Greece in 1947 that effort was thwarted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:52.320
by the Truman Doctrine it was by such means&nbsp;
that the Communists took over Czechoslovakia&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.320 --> 00:01:01.320
in 1948 it was by such means that the Communists&nbsp;
took over the mainland of China in 1949 it was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:07.140
by such means that the Communists attempted&nbsp;
to take over Korea and Indochina beginning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:14.940
in 1950 I am well aware the landing of United&nbsp;
States troops in Lebanon could have some serious&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:21.990
consequences that is why this step was taken&nbsp;
only after the most serious consideration and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:30.990
broad consultation I have however come to the&nbsp;
sober and clear conclusion that the action was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:37.350
essential to the welfare of the United States&nbsp;
it was required to support the principles of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:45.240
justice and international law upon which peace&nbsp;
and a stable international order depends we must&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:53.760
however be prepared to meet the situation whatever&nbsp;
be the consequences we can do so confident that we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.760 --> 00:02:00.660
strive for a world in which nations be they&nbsp;
great or be they small can preserve their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:07.620
independence we're striving for an ideal which&nbsp;
is close to the heart of every American and for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:15.060
which in the past many Americans have laid&nbsp;
down their to say these ideals is to serve&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:23.280
the cause of peace security and well-being&nbsp;
not only for us but for all men everywhere

